From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tdh: decoding handles, provider enumeration (3588)

tdh: decoding handles, provider enumeration, event information lookup

TdhOpenDecodingHandle/TdhCloseDecodingHandle, TdhUnloadManifest, TdhGetEventInformation (no schema is
known: ERROR_NOT_FOUND) and TdhEnumerateProviders, which lists the publishers registered under
WINEVT\Publishers with their names, in the PROVIDER_ENUMERATION_INFO layout (size query via
ERROR_INSUFFICIENT_BUFFER).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---
